{
  "id": "60",
  "title": "爱憎赋",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“爱憎赋”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "富莫富于纯粹，贫莫贫于战争；贵莫贵于秀实，贱莫贱于反伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-fb601f68e9b697766766-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "文辞称辨，贵马会于学堂。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-3a44b6330ba50bd9adbb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "锦绣文章，火木合于性情。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-2cb22fab64b291f09bcf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "深谋远虑，德性居沉静之宫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-3e48f0a23eed26cb1706-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "术业精微，帝座守文章之馆。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-913794598d621a4ed897-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "吉福生旺禄马，全要精神。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-fbd3e359b2403eeac87f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "魁罡有灵变之机。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-0f70b56116f733965de7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "离（火）坎（水）乃聪明之户。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-1876afd8aefedcc96c24-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贵人禄马，宜逢劫刃，空亡奇远。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-643b7831243cf993d070-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "长生，招君子之可爱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-e1125f34d4d0dac0ad35-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "衰败，遇小人之憎嫌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-27627a3e0a1927d92767-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱斗乱兮，不仁不义。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-6f7b5454e5dd87e4f048-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行相生兮，为孝为忠。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-7605fdf0906051d5a401-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬在刑冲之内，心乱身忘。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-e1b3e39d00fd51667737-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日时居墓库之中，忧多乐少。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-5926ab462226090b6760-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日干旺，而灾咎寡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-8d3b5de01520b93b1bf1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财命衰，而惆悵多。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-9fd95435d51770056021-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "衣食奔波，旺处遭刑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-dd9ff53aff5d1fa6840e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "利名成败，贵地逢伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-e00d58cf667bd2c6ca0c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "平生祸福，赖于一时；一世吉凶，凭于气运。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-387b252ae2f2f322300a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "福有气而变通陞迁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-1f0bde7e40cfa04ffc15-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁剋运凶，无气而人离散。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-ee5b8eb3cced1bea96b9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大运凶，而生百祸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-8ddebff382c843ba00ae-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "流年吉，而除千殃。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-08e9a7a048cb97e91e15-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "无绝至绝，财命危倾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-2b69294301e7fd370e32-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "本主得生，利名称遂。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-4604bd0d81edcda551d7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "三合六合，逢之吉重祸轻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-67332814c8f3869c646c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七杀四凶，遇之祸深福浅。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-7ccb7dd38d92ed06731e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "加官进职，定因禄会之年。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-b8ba82c82e2d6c535078-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "广置根基，必是合财之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-8deebbc26fad4131c9f8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁君冲压主凶灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-e0c951a44dfe91cb38a4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大运受伤殊少吉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-d2bcf3f76c686278131b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁宜生运，运喜生身；三位相生，一年称意。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-251649c89e5c3b03c497-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官俱旺，应显达于仕途。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-e17f0192cc0575977717-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财食均縈，岂淹留于白屋。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-9fd8dc5e306274fb0355-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄入聚生之地，富贵可知。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-a822d5d77d200eb17da3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "马奔禄旺之乡，荣华可断。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-9b93a0ba4df34416610d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "欲取交关利息，须寻六合相扶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-68888635f7d59d80cdbb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官带禄朝元，定主安然获福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-12d5ed5ac5700a59bdcf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月衰时旺，早岁丰肥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-c8034cd11e82827c83e6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木重土轻，终身漂荡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-59e86b7840748dfb9b15-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "惯取市廛之利，必因旺处逢财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-31dd376ea2e1dbf6a982-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "忽然显达成家，定是刑冲见贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-72c5f52b1d3a78b13f13-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "主本当时，得女以扶持。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-7fb044daa137be5177bc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贵禄有情，因男子而升吉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-4d1699ed7011e467901c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "南商北旅，定因马道之通；东贩西驰，必是车运之利。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-93e7c6372c3abc5fc4ea-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日干困弱，伯牛敢怨苍穹。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-1511644090f6522d1829-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄马衰微，顏子难逃短命。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-ecf29aa30aa6ffb59bd8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凶，莫凶于劫刃。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-a4e079e301ae1aa4bc40-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "吉，莫吉于刚强。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-13fe551eacf50a40b50e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官微马劣，男逃女走。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-211d05ecba34e01def7c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天罗地网，非横之灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-371d347baca54809c0cd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "脱命夭亡，遇之必不得实而死。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-1c0988df2a0347651a1c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "穷途逢劫，危疑必犯于自刑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-b0a6fb98d7b60993a54f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "绝处逢财，妻子应难谐老。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-1d43738e902d29584992-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大耗小耗，多因博戏（赌博）亡家。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-c9e021c5de57f34f8655-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官符死符，必主狱讼时有。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-bd948dbe76c2d1169d77-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "或，行四柱遇绝，三命刑伤，未免徒绞之刑，难逃黥面之苦。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-56adaded793051dc6d2a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若逢五鬼，雷伤虎咬无疑，更值群凶，恶殃横死定断；女多淫贱，男必猖狂。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-2ecec928ba388c775dbd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "或问人之情性，贤愚善恶，先推贵贱旺相之由，衰败方究机巧灵变。心高者，魁罡为祸；性顺者，六合为祥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-e6ec34859933308424b4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "观幽閒潇洒之人，遇华盖孤虚之位。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-16d632a46e79875a610a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "好恃势倚霸之辈，犯偏官劫刃之权。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-deb78fa955802150cf43-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "劫刃生鄙吝之慳，更出机关之险。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-4b75c9299d87acbb792c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "谋略大因于壬癸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-30666377465328bdc3fb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "威风气猛于丙丁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-ef36439fa6601de70165-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "孤囚遇之，无精神。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-50cb7a7fa96e4e59eeb9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "破败遇之，多疏坦。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-b567d58ba9cb64a36942-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲乙顺而仁慈大量。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-7c13f258222fddb90ffe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚辛亏而果断气刚。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-856982b42e530d72fbbb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "燥败火盛须疑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-753afc088b8a16f0666f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "隐忍金多定论。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-bd2c41656734572e9d77-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "刑战者，愚顽。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-c200b44919eb1346fae7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "安静者，贤俊。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-16f7440851b32343decc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金木司令而相生，火土逢时而相助，不劳心而衣食自足，不费力而家计自成；更若得神扶持，定是权尊乡里。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-83f5c4cf9ac74b48d3d1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄贵拱位者，臺省扬名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-b614aa4b38787458f286-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "其所忧者福不福，其所虑者成不成。福不福者，吉处遭凶；成不成者，格局见破。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-8bb30452dc08d7e77161-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤其格者，则伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-10c8c029ec99284a2380-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "破其格者，则祸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-2e73559664839c52cdb9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "譬若，苗逢秋旱，而冬廩空虚；花被春霜，而夏果无成。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-33dc0167979f5d67d0e1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "智谋思虑，措用无成，纵有回天转轴之机，而无建功立业之遂；岂不见酈生烹鼎，范生甑尘，渊明东归，子美西去，孟軻不遇，冯衍空回，买臣负薪而行歌，江革苦寒而坐泣。盖苗而不秀者有之，秀而不实者有之，更值伤败太过，一福不过芻蕘；纵有百艺多能，难免飢寒苦疾，困于沟壑，命使其然尔，淹滞无成，何劳叹嗟！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-0a8d8d9707bfe5b05b33-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "欲问富贵，全仗财官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-b219a7870f4c1f42d69c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "朕何由得之？大莫大于鎡基，奇莫奇于秀异。达圣达贤者，无时不有；至富至贵者，自古皆然。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-389e12695059dddc8cd3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "或生生月之中，文高武显。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-412c8ffa9f686a665e06-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "或居冠带之下，业大财奇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-42133d8c3c71ac975df5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若此玄妙，何如推测？先论学堂之内，三奇四福，次察格局之外，一吉二宜。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-bf054a6ba22733371042-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若，己未见甲午为祥，壬申见丁巳为瑞。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-e4b89e462200bfed0647-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬子丙午，主光风儒雅之人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-fd6a5aebfe8ff8c96474-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛酉丙申，长俊秀荣华之士。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-ddbd310f0ddf60dcf8bf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阴阳全凭纯美。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-08596891d1a6fe3e59d7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "造化最喜相生。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-ec12695fc9b6c42bc145-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "难辨者日精月华，莫测者金堂玉匱，得之者荣，遇之者贵。若遇贤愚显晦，无非造化钧陶，物既荣枯，为人岂无成败；假若凤生于雉，蛇化为龙，芳兰不断蓬蒿，枯木犹生于山野。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-4c6849fc94278fe74b6f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "少贵老贱，初迍后亨；盖由大运之衰旺，以致富贵之更变。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-040d444d3de052576544-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "格局纯而反杂，惆悵残春。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-0774fc1c5b2b31969125-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "运行老而得时，优游晚景。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-58afafa31808d44073e5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "防不测运之艰危，是以时有春秋，月圆有缺。尝观资荫之子，亲一丧定无聊；复见﹛田井﹜钓之人，运一通而殊显。多年爵禄，一旦俱休；时运至者，片时相遇。值生旺者，未必为凶；有情者通，无情者滞；有合者吉，有冲者凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-d76b03bbc926c3cca0c5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官印岁临，仕途定知进擢。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-1b9a143f84c25a1f4fac-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食财运遇，庶民亦喜荣昌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-6272efbb6c8f82876109-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "或有少依祖父之荣，长借儿孙之贵；又有垂髫难苦，至老无依；盖因四柱之旺衰，所由大运之亨否。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-dfea29597f3b425375cb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岂不见枯槁之木，纵逢春而不荣；茂盛之标，虽凌霜而不败。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-e2cbdf6526739f627765-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "论日更亏年月，定无下稍。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-2f3bf0cd65d9cb676f99-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生时旺气朝元，必有晚福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-6ce95b4803e34a819bd6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "古有琢磨之玉，值价连城；世有正直之人，自成家计；如烹炼之餘而不朽，如岁寒之后而不凋。消息妙在变通，祸福当察衰旺，庶几君子，共鉴是幸！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "60-bb2a9c0ddaf95c51069c-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
